cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CRANE: Post-Hoc Counterfactual Retrieval for Multimodal Classifiers"
abstract: >
  cf-lib is a Python library for generating nearest-neighbour counterfactual
  explanations for multimodal classifiers. It supports tabular, time-series,
  and text modalities, and provides unimodal generators (TabularNN,
  TimeSeriesNN, TextNN) as well as multimodal strategies (EF-NN,
  IF-NN, MPS, MC-R).
